   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "大促时，你在搜索结果里看到一件衣服，标着一个到手价。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.953
    },
    {
     "text": "加购去结算，价格反而更低，红包抵扣这时才算上。",
     "start": 5.233,
     "dur": 4.728
    },
    {
     "text": "这是出 bug 了吗？",
     "start": 10.241,
     "dur": 1.73
    }
   ]
  },
  "hook-2": {
   "start": 368,
   "duration": 211,
   "audioFrames": 201,
   "audioSec": 6.7,
   "chapter": "hook",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 368,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "其实不是，是网站故意这么做的。",
     "start": -0.016,
     "dur": 3.212
    },
    {
     "text": "我们先看看，要是不这么做，会发生什么。",
     "start": 3.476,
     "dur": 3.237
    }
   ]
  },
  "avalanche-1": {
   "start": 579,
   "duration": 213,
   "audioFrames": 205,
   "audioSec": 6.833,
   "chapter": "avalanche",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "算一个到手价，后台要同时去找商品价格、优惠券和红包几个服务，全回来才能算。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 6.823
    }
   ]
  },
  "avalanche-2": {
   "start": 792,
   "duration": 569,
   "audioFrames": 559,
   "audioSec": 18.633,
   "chapter": "avalanche",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 213,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "大促时红包服务卡住了，到手价计算就一直等着它，请求越积越多，计算服务也被拖垮，连购物车和结算页的价格都算不出来。",
     "start": 0.003,
     "dur": 11.736
    },
    {
     "text": "一个服务出问题，一层层往上传，最后整个网站都崩了，这就叫雪崩。",
     "start": 12.019,
     "dur": 6.626
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-1": {
   "start": 1361,
   "duration": 269,
   "audioFrames": 261,
   "audioSec": 8.7,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "想想家里的电闸。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 1.684
    },
    {
     "text": "某个电器短路了，那一路的空气开关「啪」地跳下来，只断这一路，冰箱和灯照常用。",
     "start": 1.964,
     "dur": 6.723
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-2": {
   "start": 1630,
   "duration": 326,
   "audioFrames": 316,
   "audioSec": 10.533,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 269,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "网站也装了这样的开关：发现红包服务老是出错，就先跳闸，不再去调用它，到手价计算也不再等它。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 8.543
    },
    {
     "text": "这就叫熔断。",
     "start": 8.823,
     "dur": 1.71
    }
   ]
  },
  "half-open-1": {
   "start": 1956,
   "duration": 247,
   "audioFrames": 239,
   "audioSec": 7.967,
   "chapter": "half-open",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "跳闸以后，也不能一直断着。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 2.293
    },
    {
     "text": "过一会儿，网站会先放一个请求过去试一试，这个状态叫半开。",
     "start": 2.573,
     "dur": 5.396
    }
   ]
  },
  "half-open-2": {
   "start": 2203,
   "duration": 395,
   "audioFrames": 385,
   "audioSec": 12.833,
   "chapter": "half-open",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 247,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "试成功了，说明红包服务好了，就合上闸恢复调用；还是失败，就继续断开，过一阵再试。",
     "start": 0.016,
     "dur": 7.435
    },
    {
     "text": "另外每次调用都设个等待上限，叫超时，绝不死等。",
     "start": 7.731,
     "dur": 5.086
    }
   ]
  },
  "degrade-1": {
   "start": 2598,
